  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Angular retardation,\r\n\r\n$\\begin{aligned} \\alpha &=\\frac{\\omega_{2}-\\omega_{1}}{t}=\\frac{2 \\pi\\left(\\mathrm{n}_{2}-\\mathrm{n}_{1}\\right)}{\\mathrm{t}} \\\\ &=\\frac{2 \\pi(0-900 / 60)}{60}=\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\mathrm{rad} / \\mathrm{s}^{2} \\end{aligned}$",
